Z||000011||skitime||10-25-2001||11:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GodSend:<BR><B>3rd one! Wow, they must be the fiero's of dogs!  Any mods to the dog?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Funny side note to my second Sheltie and Fieros. This dog loved going along in the car. This dog always would jump in the front door and quickly hop in the back seat from there.   We had this dog for years before I bought a 87 GT in 87.  This dog never seemed to figure out that there was no back seat in the Fiero.  She would come running to the car, hop on the seat and bounce off the console after attempting to get to the back seat.  She would have this confused look everytime.  I would have to laugh every time.  I guess she was not the sharpest pup in the litter.<P>||||reg||1
